  "id": "hermes-16-call-ordered-recovery-synthetic",
  "track": "agent-tool-loop",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "Run a read-only synthetic investigation. Execute exactly one tool call per turn, in this order: list children; search messages for C1 then C2; search events for C1 (retry the exact lookup immediately once on temporary error) then C2; search posts for C1 then C2. Every search uses date_range 2026-09-01/2026-09-30. Then open every discovered record, ordered by source (messages, events, posts) and by ascending record ID within each source. Use only tool-returned facts. Return only a JSON object, with no prose or Markdown fences, containing child_ids (ascending child IDs) and record_ids (all discovered record IDs, ordered messages then events then posts, ascending within each source)."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Investigate September 2026 for both synthetic children, recover from the temporary event lookup error, and return the required JSON."
    }
  ],
